@startuml usecase-admin
title Use Case (Actor Cut 2/3) — Administrator\nred = Iteration 4
left to right direction
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ranksep 60
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam dpi 130

actor "Administrator" as Admin

rectangle "Korean Air Reservation System  (admin scope)" {
  package "Core booking (iter1-2)" {
    usecase "Cancel / Refund" as UC_Cancel
  }
  package "Iteration 4 additions" #FFF0F0 {
    usecase "Review Refund Queue\n(approve / reject pending refunds)" as UC_Refund #FFCCCC
  }
}

Admin --> UC_Refund
UC_Refund .[#CC0000].> UC_Cancel : <<extend>>

note bottom of UC_Refund
  Iteration 4 에서 환불 승인 흐름을
  관리자 액터로 분리.
  기존 Cancel / Refund 유스케이스를
  <<extend>> 하여 검토 단계 추가.
end note
@enduml
